# DECOMPOSE — gates (checklist)

**Канон (проза/таблицы):** `workflow-decompose.mdc` · behavior-first · legacy-fallback-cleanup  
**Артефакт:** `memory-bank/back/plan/<plan_id>/yaml/decompose-index.yaml` + `yaml/steps/sNN-*.yaml` (+ `md/decompose-index.md`)  
**`<plan_id>` HARD:** stem plan **со descriptive slug** (`plan/<plan_id>/md/plan.md`) — @.cursor/rules/shared/epic-scoped-paths.mdc §Folder naming.

## PASS checklist

1. Plan из `load_now` / `plan-<id>`; L3–4 → все shards
2. Index: Requirements coverage · Stages coverage · Outcome map · Replacement cleanup (A|B|C|**I**)
3. Каждый AC+/AC−/FR/NFR → sNN или `out_of_scope`+`follow_up` **в queue**; FR nouns verbatim ∈ `produces`/`files`
4. Covered row ⇒ measurable `verify` (не map-only / не surrogate-only для product FR)
5. Titles outcome-first; matrix/lifecycle/existing-services → отдельные sNN **только при отдельном outcome** (не micro-ladder schema→CLI→wire)
5a. **Granularity:** target 5–8 sNN (≤9 L3/L4); `>9` → justification в index; audit-хвост / docs+Kind I / core+CLI — сливать. @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-behavior-first.mdc §3a
6. Каждый `sNN`: `epic-decompose/v1` + `role: back` + list `as_built`/`delta` + `deletes` + `plan_contract` + `code_surface` + Core(4) ∪ situational ≤6
7. Brownfield ≠ n/a → `deletes` + `*-legacy-fallback-purge` (+ Kind I)
8. CLI: `validate-decompose-tree` exit 0 · `validate-traceability` **CRITICAL=0**
9. Next = **BACK ANALYZE** only — **FORBIDDEN** `ANALYZE deferred`
10. Plan: index = sole tracker; Goal/NFR не сжаты до infra-only

